---
/**
 * Getting started — every step of using cairn, from an empty repository to a
 * component running in production.
 *
 * The other pages argue; this one is a procedure. A reader comes back to it with
 * a terminal open beside them, which is why the steps are numbered once across
 * the whole page rather than restarting per group, and why the commands are
 * verbatim.
 *
 * The groups say who does what and how often. The count says that nothing was
 * left out — a step somebody has to ask a colleague about is a step this page is
 * missing.
 */
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro'
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro'
import Section from '../components/Section.astro'
import StepList from '../components/StepList.astro'
import DefinitionRow from '../components/DefinitionRow.astro'
import RoleBadge from '../components/RoleBadge.astro'
import RichText from '../components/RichText.astro'
import Text from '../components/ui/Text.astro'
import Code from '../components/ui/Code.astro'
import { stepGroups, stepCount } from '../fixtures/steps'
import { promotionRoutes } from '../fixtures/promotion'
---

<Page
  title="Getting started — cairn"
  description={`${stepCount} steps, in order, from an empty repository to a component running in production.`}
>
  <PageIntro
    title="Getting started"
    lead={`${stepCount} steps, in order, from an empty repository to a component running in production.`}
  >
    <Text class="mt-6 max-w-2xl">
      The other pages say what cairn is and what each role does with it. This one is the order: who
      does what, when, and every step there is. Somebody who has never seen cairn should be able to
      follow it without asking anyone — so nothing is summarised and nothing is left out.
    </Text>
  </PageIntro>

  <div class="mt-16 space-y-16">
    {
      stepGroups.map((group) => (
        <Section title={group.title} tone={group.readBy === 'both' ? 'default' : group.readBy}>
          <RoleBadge slot="eyebrow" role={group.readBy} />
          <Text slot="eyebrow" variant="note" as="div">
            {group.cadence}
          </Text>

          <Text class="max-w-2xl">
            <RichText copy={group.why} />
          </Text>

          <StepList class="mt-8" steps={group.steps} start={group.start} />
        </Section>
      ))
    }

    <Section title="Where things land" tone="developer">
      <Text class="max-w-2xl">
        The table steps 7 and 25 refer to. Paths are relative to <Code>design/</Code>, and the last
        row is the one that matters: mock data is never promoted, it is replaced.
      </Text>

      <dl class="mt-8 border-t border-rule">
        {
          promotionRoutes.map((route) => (
            <DefinitionRow term={route.from}>
              <RichText copy={route.to} />
            </DefinitionRow>
          ))
        }
      </dl>

      <Text variant="note" class="mt-6 max-w-2xl">
        Here the right-hand column is empty, and it says why: in this guide the workbench is the
        deliverable, so there is no project to carry anything into.
      </Text>
    </Section>
  </div>
</Page>
